1. Understand HTTPS,SSH,GitHub CLI in git

HTTPS ans SSH ways to connect git to github.
GitHub CLI is a tool for managing GitHub from the command line.

Https: GitHub Authenticates you using credentials/token. Usually Through github credential manager or a browser-based login.
SSH: Create SHH key on computer and add the public key to github.
GitHub CLI: It is a command line program for working with github.


